<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan inflation quickens to 1.2 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan inflation quickens to 1.2 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's monthly inflation quickened to 1.2 percent in September from 0.7 percent in August, the state statistics committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKHSTAN MONTHLY INFLATION   SEP 96   AUG 96   SEP 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	+1.2     +0.7     +2.4</p>
<p>The committee did not give a yearly inflation figure.</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
